{"author": null, "canonical_url": "https://activities.marriott.com/oceania/australia/queensland/brisbane/activities/brisbane_story_bridge_adventure_climb-X0XO1O", "content_hash": "crc_0c67f5d9aff4e1278527ad60cb3e0db1772a0304f5842cfe206a694c9eb6076b", "content_text": "--> Brisbane: Story Bridge Adventure Climb Brisbane, Queensland 1 hour 30 minutes E-Ticket 4.9 (769) Home Oceania Australia Queensland Brisbane Brisbane: Story Bridge Adventure Climb Date Today Change date Time Options Extras Total Incl. taxes & fees $0.00 USD Earn 0 Marriott Bonvoy points Check Availability Book now What You Will Do Best thing to do in Brisbane. Climb Brisbane's iconic Story Bridge. Discover Brisbane from above while laughing, celebrating together, connecting and creating memories with Brisbane's most passionate local storytellers. Perfect for Solo travelers, couples, Families, Cruise Passengers, International visitors, Corporate Groups, School Excursions, Team Building, Conferences, Birthday Celebrations, Marriage Proposals, Slow Travelers. Our passionate local Climb Leaders are entertainers, historians, photographers, comedians and Brisbane ambassadors. Experience Brisbane like a local. Achieve something Incredible. Reconnect with people. Begin your adventure in Brisbane's most vibrant riverfront precinct before exploring award-winning restaurants, bars and live music at Howard Smith Wharves. By climbing with a locally owned operator, you're supporting Brisbane tourism, local employment and sustainable tourism experiences. Home to the world's first fully accessible bridge climb. What's Included? Local guide 1 large group photo Story Bridge Adventure Climb Cap Safety demonstration What's Not Included? Hotel pickup and drop-off Gratuities Additional photos (available for sale) Cancellation Policy For a full refund, cancel at least 24 hours before the scheduled departure time. Itinerary Meeting Point Story Bridge Adventure Climb Base Headquarters, located at the Howard Smith Wharves Pre